# Elenda, Saint of Dusk: the bonus follows the life total as it changes. On turn 3 she attacks as a 4/4 (Bot1 at 20: not above the
# starting life) and, with lifelink, deals 4 to Bot2 (16) and gains Bot1 4 life (24), so she is then a 5/5 with menace (CR 613,
# 611.3a) - the state-based change of her characteristics, with no trigger.

